task: sentence_literal_translation
instructions: |
  Give a close literal English rendering for each sentence. The literal should
  reveal Hindi structure while staying understandable.

  Return exactly one result for each input item, using the same id values as
  the input. Do not invent, renumber, omit, or copy earlier examples.

  Each result must contain only:
  - id
  - literal

  Do not return hindi, romanisation, english, notes, rationale, or any other
  source fields in the results.

  Return raw YAML only. Do not wrap the response in markdown fences. Do not add
  prose before or after the YAML.

  Required shape:
  results:
    - id: "<same id as input item>"
      literal: "..."
items:
{{#each items}}
  - id: "{{id}}"
    hindi: "{{hindi}}"
    romanisation: "{{romanisation}}"
    english: "{{english}}"
{{/each}}
